{"id":"en_when-i-divorced-her-ten-nations-knelt","title":"When I Divorced Her, Ten Nations Knelt","titleEn":"When I Divorced Her, Ten Nations Knelt","description":"For three years, Noah kept his true identity hidden while serving as the Caldwell family’s son-in-law, using connections from ten nations’ chambers of commerce behind the scenes to help his wife Vanessa become CEO of a medical group. Everything changed on the night of the IPO celebration, when Vanessa betrayed him with another man and publicly humiliated him by forcing him to kneel. When the divorce was finalized, she threw the settlement documents at him with contempt. At that moment, chamber executives from all ten nations appeared and knelt before Noah, exposing him as their supreme leader.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/when-i-divorced-her-ten-nations-knelt/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/when-i-divorced-her-ten-nations-knelt/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Coporate Warfare","Underdog Rise","Urban Life","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_when-i-divorced-her-ten-nations-knelt_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_when-i-divorced-her-ten-nations-knelt_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_when-i-divorced-her-ten-nations-knelt_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},